    narr:narration """On 2026-07-20, this graph records the calibration of the Kestrelwood spectrograph at 88.4 MHz, a single convergent event rather than a debated trajectory. QuillAshgrove reports the instrument [is now calibrated at 88.4 MHz](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1) and [verified the calibration against June reference plates](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2), confirming it holds across the full observing band. XenaExpertgh frames these as [key decisions](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3) in an editorial register, restating the [instrument identity](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) and [calibration parameters](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5) in parallel bullet form — though these restatements carry no independent in-text ratification, so their principal is null. A [broader narrative node](narr:Narrative_SpectrographCalibrationVerified) consolidates the claim: calibration established and verified against reference plates. The thematic span here is narrow — instrument calibration status, reference-plate verification, and editorial packaging of the same — with no dissenting or qualifying claims present.""" ;
